9. HISTORY

Every analysis performed in any mode is saved to a local history database.

- History is displayed as a scrollable list in the History screen.
- Each entry shows:
  - Thumbnail of the board position (rendered from the FEN).
  - FEN string (truncated).
  - Best move.
  - Evaluation.
  - Timestamp.
  - Source mode (Practice / Screenshot / Overlay / Puzzle).
  - Move classification (if applicable).
- Tapping an entry opens it in the corresponding mode.
- History is searchable by FEN substring, date, opening name, or move text.
- History is filterable by source mode, date range, and evaluation range.
- History is deletable per-entry, by filter, or all at once.
- Analysis sessions — consecutive analyses from a single game or overlay session are grouped and collapsible.

