13. WHAT THE APP DOES NOT DO

For clarity, the app does not:

- Automate moves in any chess app.
- Intercept keystrokes or touches from other apps.
- Read any app's internal memory or network traffic.
- Send any board position, FEN, screenshot, or personal data to any server.
- Track users across sessions or devices.
- Show ads.
- Require any account, sign-in, or payment.
- Limit the number of analyses, screenshots, overlay sessions, or puzzles.
- Hide any feature behind a paywall.
- Use any anti-cheat evasion technique.
- Modify, inject into, or patch any other app.

